1
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,240
How about a lollipop as a reward?

2
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,159
Okay.

3
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:53,840
Here you go.

4
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,600
How is it? Is it good?

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,200
It's good!

6
00:00:59,359 --> 00:01:01,359
Let's swap it for another one.

7
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:04,280
How about a yellow one?

8
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,200
Okay.

9
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,879
Give that one to me.

10
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,920
Today, you're the luckiest kid

11
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,840
in the whole world!

12
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,640
See you next time!

13
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,040
What exactly do you want?

14
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,920
What do I want?

15
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,719
I've prepared a little gift for you guys.

16
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:04,120
Cut the cryptic act.

17
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:06,239
It's not for you.

18
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,520
Do you know how you got that limp?

19
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:20,680
This is for you.

20
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,599
This is the real reason you fell.

21
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:56,680
Remember now?

22
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,960
Did you take this off?

23
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:03,960
Don't listen to her nonsense.

24
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:05,800
Why would I take it off?

25
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,479
What even is this?

26
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,560
Who knows where she got it from.

27
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,520
How can you prove this came from my car?

28
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,319
I can't prove it.

29
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,960
That car...

30
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,400
...your husband got rid of it long ago.

31
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:24,400
Lin Yajing!

32
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:26,759
Have you no shame?

33
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,520
What did I dispose of?

34
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,520
Besides, Qianqian is my wife.

35
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,479
What good would doing that do me?

36
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,280
Plenty of good.

37
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:41,319
How so?

38
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:45,039
Didn't you give the reason before dinner?

39
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,000
Zhou Minglei!

40
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,240
Zhou Minglei!

41
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,280
Dinner is ready.

42
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,439
Only at times like this

43
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,079
do you truly depend on me.

44
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,600
Did my illness that time

45
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,920
give you an idea?

46
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,120
What do you mean?

47
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,600
I was really sick that time.

48
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,680
For the first time in my life,

49
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,560
I was actually nice to you, wasn't I?

50
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,040
So you came up with this trick

51
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:59,160
to give me an incurable disease.

52
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,399
Qianqian, Qianqian.

53
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,759
You have to believe me.

54
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:07,959
Think about it, we have a son.

55
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,480
Xiao Yu.

56
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,839
You think I'd do something like this?

57
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,000
Fine.

58
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,759
Then I'll look into everything, okay?

59
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,439
The street cameras,

60
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,560
the hospital records,

61
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:27,160
and exactly where you went that day.

62
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:31,000
I'm going to uncover every single detail.

63
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,480
I just want my dignity back.

64
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,360
Makes sense.

65
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,920
In the eyes of those women,

66
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,120
you really are high and mighty.

67
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,120
And in your eyes?

68
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,160
I've never looked down on you.

69
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,720
Saying that means you look down on me.

70
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:17,000
Aren't you just too insecure?

71
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,800
Me, insecure?

72
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,480
I'm an M.D. from a top university.

73
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,680
I'm only insecure around you.

74
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,360
Then have you ever thought

75
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,920
that maybe the problem isn't me?

76
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:37,199
Enough!

77
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,000
You've talked enough nonsense.

78
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,519
When are you letting our child go?

79
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:44,040
Your child?

80
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,519
As far as I know,

81
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,319
in here,

82
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,360
it seems there's no child of yours.

83
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,759
Psycho!

84
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:53,879
Xu Hui,

85
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:58,399
you didn't even tell him about this?

86
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:02,439
Here's a gift for you.

87
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,839
What gift?

88
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,839
What's wrong?

89
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,720
Aren't you happy?

90
00:07:23,839 --> 00:07:24,759
What's your plan?

91
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,839
I haven't decided yet.

92
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:31,720
Keep it or abort it.

93
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,879
Depends on what the baby's father thinks.

94
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,959
I've made up my mind.

95
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,199
Let's keep the baby.

96
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:50,920
After all, it's the fruit of our love.

97
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,519
You're crazy.

98
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,600
I just want to have the baby.

99
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,879
How is that crazy?

100
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,160
I don't love you.

101
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,160
I've never loved you.

102
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,480
You know that, right?

103
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,600
I know.

104
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,839
But you've always wanted to be a father.

105
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,560
I also know

106
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,240
you don't want me to be the mother.

107
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,240
Once the baby is born,

108
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,399
you'll have nothing to do with it.

109
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,720
Then what do I get?

110
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,560
Ten million.

111
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,800
Okay.

112
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,759
Ten million a year.

113
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,040
Bitch! I'll tear your mouth apart!

114
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,639
What nonsense are you spouting?

115
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,639
What are you talking about?

116
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,320
Shut up!

117
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,080
What do you mean?

118
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,799
Do you remember

119
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,799
taking Xiaochen

120
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:44,279
to the paternity test center?

121
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:54,240
Dad, what are we doing here?

122
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,679
Xiaochen, do you want to play soccer?

123
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,799
I do.

124
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,279
Let's go play soccer.

125
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:06,879
Yay, soccer!

126
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,559
Xiaochen, let's play a match today, okay?

127
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,679
If you win,

128
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:18,240
I'll treat you to something good, okay?

129
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:18,759
Okay!

130
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:19,639
What do you want to eat?

131
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,960
What do you want to eat? Burgers?

132
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,879
You sent our samples for testing.

133
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:36,879
Yes.

134
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:49,080
I won't believe it.

135
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,799
Deep down, you already know the answer.

136
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,759
Why else would you take the child

137
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,200
for a paternity test?

138
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,039
Face the truth.

139
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,240
Xiaochen

140
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,320
is not your daughter.

141
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
You're lying!

142
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,080
No need to thank me.

143
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:09,039
I've found her biological father for you.

144
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,600
Want to see for yourself?

145
00:10:17,679 --> 00:10:18,440
She's making it up!

146
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,559
She's crazy!

147
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,039
How is this possible?

148
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:47,960
Whose is the other sample?

149
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:51,120
It's someone

150
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:53,519
you've always looked down on.

151
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,519
Don't look at me.

152
00:10:59,440 --> 00:10:59,960
Lao Gao.

153
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,840
What does this prove?

154
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:04,080
I didn't take any tests.

155
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:06,120
What's it got to do with me, right?

156
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,759
Didn't expect that, did you?

157
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,039
We actually met once before.

158
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,679
When have I ever met you?

159
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,000
Don't worry.

160
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:23,559
I won't say a word.

161
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,679
What if I bring a bottle of red wine

162
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,000
as a gift?

163
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:37,559
Don't worry.

164
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,559
I'll definitely buy a premium one.

165
00:12:06,679 --> 00:12:08,360
Lao Gao, don't believe her.

166
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,399
It's just a paternity test report.

167
00:12:10,559 --> 00:12:11,320
It's easy to fake one.

168
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,440
Just like you guys faked one back then?

169
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,960
I've always wondered...

170
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,159
why you absolutely had to

171
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,480
drag Liu Yang into this.

172
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,120
Looks like you really fell in love with him.

173
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,720
You're the one I love.

174
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,720
How could it be Liu Yang?

175
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:32,080
Xiaochen is your child.

176
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,559
You are Xiaochen's father.

177
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:36,200
You know that better than anyone, right?

178
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:39,120
How could you believe her?

179
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,960
Of course I don't.

180
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,720
I'll do another paternity test.

181
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,559
If it's true,

182
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:50,840
I'll make life a living hell for you two.

183
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,840
Why drag me down with you?

184
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,879
I only wanted to help you back then!

185
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,200
You wanted to help me?

186
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,720
You don't actually think

187
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,759
that I don't remember anything, do you?
